# --- Swedish (`sv-se`): bulky / reproducible source material ---
# Do not commit raw downloads or API outputs used only to rebuild curated artifacts.
# Shipped in-repo (for a clone-and-run experience): `locales/sv-se/references/*` (JSON/TSV/baseline
# text, empirical tables), `src/locales/generated/sv-prescriptive.js`, committed fixtures under
# `locales/sv-se/tests/fixtures/sv-corpus/{human,ai,human-gold,prompts}/`, `reports/calibration-sv-latest.json`.
# Optional extended Swedish corpus (Wikipedia extracts, etc.)
locales/sv-se/tests/fixtures/sv-corpus-extended/
tests/fixtures/sv-corpus-extended/

# Optional bulk imports you add by hand (Korp exports, dumps) before scripts consume them
locales/sv-se/data/raw/

# Optional multi-model LLM outputs for log-odds (API keys required to generate)
locales/sv-se/tests/fixtures/sv-corpus/ai-llm/

# Swedish pipeline resume state + log (sv-pipeline.mjs)
locales/sv-se/.pipeline/

# English ML calibration artifacts (regenerate: npm run en:ml:dataset && npm run en:ml:train)
locales/en-en/references/ml-dataset-en.jsonl
locales/en-en/references/en-calibrator.json
locales/en-en/.pipeline/
locales/en-en/data/wiki-human/wiki-api-*.txt
